# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PRoast Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# REQUIRED: Core Application
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Your production domain (MUST change for production!)
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Anthropic API Key (required for roasting)
# Get yours at: https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# REQUIRED: Supabase (Database & Auth)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Get these from: https://app.supabase.com/project/_/settings/api
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# REQUIRED: Stripe (Payments)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Get these from: https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys
NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_...
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_...

# Get this from: https://dashboard.stripe.com/webhooks
# Create a webhook endpoint pointing to: https://yourdomain.com/api/stripe/webhook
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...

# Price IDs for subscriptions
# Create products at: https://dashboard.stripe.com/products
# Pro: $12/month
STRIPE_PRICE_PRO_MONTHLY=price_...
# Team: $49/month (or your team pricing)
STRIPE_PRICE_TEAM_MONTHLY=price_...

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# REQUIRED: GitHub OAuth (for PR roasting)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Create OAuth App at: https://github.com/settings/developers
# Callback URL: https://yourdomain.com/api/auth/github/callback
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=Iv1.xxx
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=xxx

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PRODUCTION CHECKLIST
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Before deploying to production, ensure:
#
# 1. NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL is set to your production domain
# 2. All Stripe keys are LIVE keys (not test keys)
# 3. Stripe webhook is configured for your production domain
# 4. Supabase database has the schema applied (see supabase/schema.sql)
# 5. GitHub OAuth callback URL matches your production domain
# 6. No placeholder values remain (search for "xxx" or "...")
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
